            "notes": "## Powers\n\n[Inner Peace](item_3cb26943-7c02-4aa2-97d0-7411dac1073c) is great and helps you survive, especially if you play cover well. It also generates money. This should ALWAYS be picked.\n\n## Items\n\nIn most games, I play two green HP items, since dying means you won't earn cash, and 5% WP isn't super impactful early on. Always go [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6), then [Siphon Gloves](item_099f8177-c2a4-4e13-b321-99349f8b1eb7) if there are heroes that want to get on top of you, otherwise go [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da).\n\nIf you still want to go more aggressive VS enmies that are good match ups for you then you can go [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0), [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) and [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) or [Running Shoes](item_950eccea-31a0-4a55-8c2a-75bf7920e1aa).",
