            "notes": "## Items\n\nMore green HP items: you want to have 2 at minimum, but you can get up to 5, which is the maximum.\n\nIf you have a lot of money, you can get [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09), only buy it if you have 2 green HP items already though.  [Emergency Chip](item_c73e060f-94df-4e6b-bb6d-fe2f65e31dd1) is similar but more aggressive.",
