            "notes": "## Powers\n\nIn most rounds you should go for [Enlightenment](item_8392e752-ca6b-487d-9580-11eab6075c3c). It generates more money and heals you when you shoot a discorded target.\n\nSometimes I\u2019ll pick [Discord Inferno](item_cf48f92d-a1d1-420a-b0e3-01ed290faa62) if there are easy to headshot heroes,  few threats or I'm ahead by a lot.\n\nIf the enemy team has a lot of annoying heroes like Genji, Freja, or D.Va, then [Instant Karma](item_7a1cb409-3f6d-424f-882f-729c59476130) is a good alternative.\n\n## Items\n\nIn most rounds I go for [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c), since the way it currently works is a 20% damage reduction basically. Zen benefits a lot from the extra HP, and its effect pairs really well with [Inner Peace](item_3cb26943-7c02-4aa2-97d0-7411dac1073c).\n\nIf you want to take the damage route, then take either [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121) or [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f), because they both have HP but my favorite is for sure [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121) from these. [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) is good VS a lot of armor.\n\nIf you have even more money you can get [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b), but in most cases, if you have more money, you should get [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09).",
