            "notes": "## Items\n\n[Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) is the key. This essentially makes you 10% more tanky as long as you have shields or armor (1.1x your HP). It also means that whenever you are healing yourself with [Inner Peace](item_3cb26943-7c02-4aa2-97d0-7411dac1073c), and you're healing shields or armor, it is 10% more valuable. If you are going against a lot of AP enemies, then you can do the same by just getting [Reinforced Titanium](item_8ebaa7db-aedf-48ed-adc1-318cb46a3214) (or both) but most damage that kills you is WP, so [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) is the better item almost always. \n\nFor our damage item, we take [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121). [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) is very similar and has the same base stats. [Orb of Perception](item_762bf2a4-c062-4dfd-b8e0-47e37ba1cadf)is another good alternative. If you have a lot of money, then taking [Eye of the Spider] is great too.\n\n## Counterpick Options\n\n[Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) since the release of [Tracer](hero_bcc3aeb4-369e-4abb-b686-3234c169d37a), I found myself picking this more and more. Armor cuts [Tracer](hero_bcc3aeb4-369e-4abb-b686-3234c169d37a) damage in half and it also works well with [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09)\n\n[Iron Eyes](item_f16d03a7-f20e-4a1d-a1f6-55863e163c03) VS heroes that like to headshot, like Kiri, Cass, Soldier, Genji (melee is crit if they play the item), Ashe (WP), Ana (Crit Power), JQ (WP), or Zen. The more I play, the more I value it because Zen is so easy to headshot.\n\n[Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) vs. DoT (Damage over Time) and debuffs such as Ashe, Ana, JQ, Mei, Moira, and Junkrat (burn Power). There are some other debuffs and slows where it\u2019s still useful, mostly from items or powers.\n\n[Stratosphere Beacon](item_15bf2dc7-5161-47b0-929b-17cbb1d54182) is a very solid item overall. Many heroes are in the air, such as Freja, Mercy, DVA, Pharah, Juno, Winston, or Genji. Stats are exactly what we want with some HP and damage.",
