            "notes": "## Powers\n\nIf you aren't dying [Discord Inferno](item_cf48f92d-a1d1-420a-b0e3-01ed290faa62) is great. It's particularly powerful against non-tanky enemies and enemies that are easy to headshot like an Ashe, Reaper, DVA, Zen, Cass, Winton or Orisa because they explode. If you have a pretty defensive build [Discord Inferno](item_cf48f92d-a1d1-420a-b0e3-01ed290faa62) is great because it adds damage. This power CAN one-shot many [Tracer](hero_bcc3aeb4-369e-4abb-b686-3234c169d37a) builds.\n\n[Soul Control](item_051aca60-1044-4184-bbbf-5aad8b12592a) is really good to generate money and helps with full healing tanks. This is very powerful if you can easily farm ult from some tanks like Rein, Orisa, DVA or Winton.\n\nThen lastly, if you are dying to a particular hero, you can go [Instant Karma](item_7a1cb409-3f6d-424f-882f-729c59476130) to give you more survivability but I'm rarely playing this.\n\n## Items\n\nIt's [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) in most games since the stats are good and it's one of the few items left that has HP attached to it. Alternatives are [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) or [Orb of Perception](item_762bf2a4-c062-4dfd-b8e0-47e37ba1cadf) or [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643). [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) should ALWAYS be picked if enough cash.\n\n[Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) VS armor as usual.\n\nUpgrade [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) for  [Emergency Chip](item_c73e060f-94df-4e6b-bb6d-fe2f65e31dd1)(or other counterpick  items from the previous round) if enough money.",
