            "notes": "## Items\n\nAt this rate, we need more damage with [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b). You can pick more defensive items as well if needed, against some comps you mostly need to just stay alive. There's also some cheaper and slightly different items listed, I would strongly consider those if it means you can keep [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09).\n\nReplace [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) with [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) if you have enough cash. You wanna keep [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) as long as possible.",
