            "notes": "## Power  \n\n[Soul Control](item_051aca60-1044-4184-bbbf-5aad8b12592a) allows you to trans your team/tank and still potentially get another ult in the same fight. It also makes you harder to kill. This is the better choice in most games.\n\n[Instant Karma](item_7a1cb409-3f6d-424f-882f-729c59476130) is still useful if you find yourself dying to one specific enemy but it's overall worse in R7 than [Soul Control](item_051aca60-1044-4184-bbbf-5aad8b12592a).\n\n## Items  \n\nThis late into the game, you mostly have to decide on your own what you want to play. The build on the site is NOT a full build but something you SHOULD be able to reach almost always. Below are two versions of a more offensive and defensive build.\n\nFor more offensive options, a full loadout would just be replacing [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) with one of these items: \n- [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643): Makes [Orb of Harmony](ability_8f354f72-fe40-43b4-8231-aac9c0523c0d), [Discord Inferno](item_cf48f92d-a1d1-420a-b0e3-01ed290faa62) and [Inner Peace](item_3cb26943-7c02-4aa2-97d0-7411dac1073c) slightly better, you will have 25% AP. Most importantly people might die through trans with debuffs if you don't have enough AP.\n- [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27): As usual VS  armor.\n- [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce) for the most damage and  if you have a lot of cash.\n\nFor more defensive options, a full loadout would be something like this:\n- [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b)\n- [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c)\n- [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d) OR [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8)\n- [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121)\n- [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f)\n- [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce) OR [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) OR [Orb of Perception](item_762bf2a4-c062-4dfd-b8e0-47e37ba1cadf)",
